		     (harness quick.rep, delta 0). Examiner override: base Trinket demands identification;
		     a carved baboon is self-evident (user flag 2026-07-24). -->
		<part Name="AddsRep" Faction="Baboons" Value="200" WorksOnCarrier="true" />
		<part Name="Examiner" Complexity="0" />
		<tag Name="ExcludeFromDynamicEncounters" />
	</object>

